  m_text: '<size=1.3em><b>Region 2: Simplifying Radicals</b></size>



    <align=center>"Huh?
    What''s that?! Uh oh! A new type of a Bomb!!!"


    Because the planted bombs
    are continupusly being neutralized, the enemies has decided to lunch a new bomb.
    Thankfully, Mr. Geartherre has also sent us a new type of neutralizer! <b> The
    RNCS or R Neutralizing Cannon Shell! or RShell for short!</b></align>




    <i><size=0.8em><align=center>Tap
    to Continue...</align></size></i>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
